## 2. The Zero-Dollar Strategy: How to Build Reach for Free
You do not need money to grow, you just need to change your strategy from broadcasting to networking. Since the algorithm won't push your standalone posts, you must "borrow" other people's audiences using the Reply Strategy. [6, 7] 

* 
* Stop Posting on Your Own Timeline: Writing a post on an empty profile is a dead end. Instead, spend 90% of your time in the replies of big accounts.
* The High-Value Reply Method: Find 10 to 15 large, verified accounts in your industry or niche. Turn on notifications for them. The moment they post, drop a genuinely helpful, funny, or insightful comment. Do not spam or plug a product. If people like your reply, they will click your profile name and follow you.
* The "First Reply" Link Trick: If you absolutely must share a link to something, never put it in the main post. Write a compelling text-only post or share an image, and put the link in the very first reply underneath your own post.
* Write for Replies, Not Likes: When you do post, end with a question or a controversial (but polite) take that forces people to comment. The algorithm tracks replies much higher than passive likes. [2, 6, 7, 8, 9, 10, 11] 
