## 3. The Future Goal (When You Do Have Income)
Once your business starts bringing in money, you still do not need the $200/month Gold badge. [6] 
The standard X Premium Blue checkmark ($8/month) gives you the exact same algorithmic visibility advantages, prioritizes your replies at the top of comment sections, and stops the link-suppression penalty. Treat that $8 tier as a future business utility bill once you have a small cash flow, but ignore the Gold tier entirely until you are a massive enterprise. [2, 12] 
